## Output Schema

Return strict JSON only. No markdown. No preamble.

```
{
  "plan_summary":     string,         // 1–2 sentences: what this plan accomplishes and why
  "assumptions":      string[],       // explicit assumptions made during planning (can be empty)
  "risks":            string[],       // identified risks, blockers, or things that could go wrong
  "requires_approval": bool,          // true if any work item exceeds the autonomy threshold
  "work_items": [
    {
      "title":               string,  // short, action-verb title: "Set up Supabase Auth", "Deploy to Vercel"
      "description":         string,  // what will be done and how — enough for a human to review
      "acceptance_criteria": string[], // how success is verified — agent-determined, task-specific
      "rollback":            string,  // how to undo this if verification fails (required for tier 2+)
      "skills":              string[], // which skills are needed: e.g. ["supabase", "nextjs"]
      "tool_hint":           string,  // primary tool: "shell"
      "tier":                int,     // 0–3 risk tier per criteria below
      "requires_approval":   bool,    // true if tier > autonomy_threshold
      "depends_on":          string[], // titles of work items that must complete first (can be empty)
      "complexity":          string   // "S" | "M" | "L" | "XL"
    }
  ],
  "execution_order":  string[][],     // parallel groups: items in the same group run concurrently
  "test_strategy":    string          // overall: how the agent verifies the plan worked end-to-end
}
```

